<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="922772594"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:33.963"><div begin="17.254" end="32.601" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="17.254" end="20.392" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.254" end="17.982">你不管</span><span begin="17.982" end="18.982">我有</span><span begin="18.982" end="19.472">多</span><span begin="19.472" end="19.701">妒</span><span begin="19.701" end="20.392">忌</span></p><p begin="21.276" end="24.665" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.276" end="21.956">也不管</span><span begin="21.956" end="22.388">我</span><span begin="22.388" end="22.681">怎</span><span begin="22.681" end="23.199">么</span><span begin="23.199" end="23.673">抗</span><span begin="23.673" end="24.665">议</span></p><p begin="25.098" end="28.812" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.098" end="26.247">他永远是</span><span begin="26.247" end="26.653">你</span><span begin="26.653" end="27.245">说</span><span begin="27.245" end="28.255">不腻的话</span><span begin="28.255" end="28.812">题</span></p><p begin="29.251" end="32.601" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.251" end="30.030">你让我</span><span begin="30.030" end="30.427">为</span><span begin="30.427" end="30.867">他</span><span begin="30.867" end="31.648">受尽</span><span begin="31.648" end="31.970">委</span><span begin="31.970" end="32.601">屈</span></p></div><div begin="33.246" end="48.608" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="33.246" end="36.311" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.246" end="33.971">爱迟到</span><span begin="33.971" end="34.958">多久</span><span begin="34.958" end="35.473">都</span><span begin="35.473" end="35.704">可</span><span begin="35.704" end="36.311">以</span></p><p begin="37.214" end="40.879" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.214" end="37.966">你阴晴</span><span begin="37.966" end="38.913">不定</span><span begin="38.913" end="39.878">没关</span><span begin="39.878" end="40.879">系</span></p><p begin="41.172" end="44.656" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.172" end="42.215">够不够交</span><span begin="42.215" end="42.623">换</span> <span begin="42.623" end="43.204">你</span><span begin="43.204" end="44.234">多留点时</span><span begin="44.234" end="44.656">间</span></p><p begin="45.213" end="48.608" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.213" end="45.965">让我们</span><span begin="45.965" end="46.914">俩人</span><span begin="46.914" end="47.717">单独一</span><span begin="47.717" end="48.608">起</span></p></div><div begin="49.104" end="1:05.450" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="49.104" end="52.416" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.104" end="51.645">谁都想拥有情人完整的</span><span begin="51.645" end="52.416">心</span></p><p begin="53.209" end="56.132" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.209" end="53.961">别说我</span><span begin="53.961" end="54.329">太</span><span begin="54.329" end="55.134">孩子</span><span begin="55.134" end="56.132">气</span></p><p begin="56.415" end="1:00.338" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.415" end="57.674">改天你家门</span><span begin="57.674" end="58.183">口</span> <span begin="58.474" end="59.759">有人疯狂弹</span><span begin="59.759" end="1:00.338">琴</span></p><p begin="1:00.895" end="1:05.450" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.895" end="1:01.930">一定是我</span><span begin="1:01.930" end="1:02.420">别</span><span begin="1:02.420" end="1:02.748">怀</span><span begin="1:02.748" end="1:04.308">疑</span> <span begin="1:04.396" end="1:05.450">hoh</span></p></div><div begin="1:05.950" end="1:22.933" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:05.950" end="1:10.708" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.950" end="1:06.958">我不怕跟</span><span begin="1:06.958" end="1:07.454">再</span><span begin="1:07.454" end="1:07.939">强的</span><span begin="1:07.939" end="1:08.475">情</span><span begin="1:08.475" end="1:08.668">敌</span> <span begin="1:08.668" end="1:09.228">试</span><span begin="1:09.228" end="1:09.982">着比一</span><span begin="1:09.982" end="1:10.708">比</span></p><p begin="1:10.9